# Zot safety

## Read-only default

List repos and tags are fine when Zot work is authorized. Do **not**:

- delete a tag, manifest, or repository
- run GC that removes unreferenced blobs the user did not ask to prune
- change auth/anonymous pull policy without an explicit verb

…unless the user gave an explicit verb this turn naming the object.

Prefer tag delete over repo wipe. Never paste htpasswd / token secrets into chat.
